<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13811] ServerImpl#pingNode(InetSocketAddress, UUID, UUID) fails to ping nodes with unresolved addresses</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13811</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Wrong key is deleted from map.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
pingMap.putIfAbsent(addr, fut)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (addr.isUnresolved())
     addr = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; InetSocketAddress(InetAddress.getByName(addr.getHostName()), addr.getPort());
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;boolean&lt;/span&gt; b = pingMap.remove(addr, fut);

&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;assert&lt;/span&gt; b;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
